le.com/drive/folders/1EbrFAQ7hNwWg-T2msiDDY80u5inoSyl2?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@moku0033/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/675740b6/uploads/origins/f44db30e-8d1d-450d-b483-2b4d715a41f7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8f70995c8b343eca27377fe7ef6c4e07", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/675740b6/uploads/origins/f44db30e-8d1d-450d-b483-2b4d715a41f7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8f70995c8b343eca27377fe7ef6c4e07, https://si.imgix.net/675740b6/uploads/origins/f44db30e-8d1d-450d-b483-2b4d715a41f7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f945845728caaf242fe3f8b521c53b2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/675740b6/uploads/origins/f44db30e-8d1d-450d-b483-2b4d715a41f7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d86ff742e9a6762fb216e15407cf65cf 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! If you're tired of him, please feel free to decline! But, if you're interested I would love another piece! If it's possible, maybe a seductive sort of atmosphere for this one? I adore your work!\n\nMy character's concept is a computer program, who is trying his best to adopt 'human' habits / learn 'human' behaviors. He is usually neutral, so please draw him however you'd like!\n\nIn the reference link, please refer to 'NEW DESIGN / 新しいデザイン' for his clothing - or, you can also dress him however you'd like - I'm okay with anything!\n\nI'll leave the pose and composition up to you, so please feel free to do what you'd like!\n\nThere are some references within the folder marked with '★' as well, I think these pieces convey his 'energy' well, so please refer to these for inspiration if you need it!\n\nSome important character details:\nEyeglasses (optional, but preferred)\nEar piercings\nBarcode tattoo on neck\nHis eye color is black\nHis haircut is an undercut, so it is very short 